    The texts of RFC 792 (Internet Control Message Protocol), RFC 1191 (Path MTU Discovery), RFC 4884
    (Extended ICMP to Support Multi-Part Messages), RFC 5927 (ICMP Attacks against TCP), RFC 6918
    (Formally Deprecating Some ICMPv4 Message Types), RFC 4443 (ICMPv6), RFC 4861 (Neighbor Discovery for
    IP version 6), RFC 6980 (Security Implications of IPv6 Fragmentation with IPv6 Neighbor Discovery),
    RFC 7048 (Neighbor Unreachability Detection Is Too Impatient) and RFC 8201 (Path MTU Discovery for IP
    version 6), downloaded from https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/ on 2026-10-26.
